# macOS artifacts
.DS_Store

# Hugo build outputs
public/
resources/
.hugo_build.lock

# Hugo server cache
dist/

# --- TBD deletion-staging quarantine (any depth) ---
# Gavin, 2026-10-18: anywhere under ~/code, at ANY depth, a folder whose name
# contains tbd/TBD in any capitalisation is deletion staging -- things moved
# aside for him to review and delete himself. `_tbd` is the usual spelling;
# the pattern matches the variants (_tbd/ _TBD/ TBD/ tbd/ 2026-10-17_TBD_x/).
# Never commit or push its contents, whatever their size.
#
# The folder's CONTENTS are excluded, not the folder, so its README.md
# deletion register stays trackable -- ~/code/CLAUDE.md requires a line there
# for every item moved in. Git cannot re-include a file under an excluded
# *directory*, hence `dir/*` + a negation rather than `dir/`.
#
# Scope: ~/code only. The _tbd/ dirs in agent_brain and agent_research are a
# DIFFERENT thing sharing the name -- the OK app syncs those vaults and their
# _tbd/ records are tracked on purpose. Never add this to ~/.gitignore_global.
# Detail: agent_brain wiki/systems/git-sync-tbd-convention.md
**/*[tT][bB][dD]*/*
!**/*[tT][bB][dD]*/README.md
